{"name": "Lootbound", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"474\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/d1b26b5f2ab79a32c61cc054290b35f4.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/d1b26b5f2ab79a32c61cc054290b35f4.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/d1b26b5f2ab79a32c61cc054290b35f4.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span><strong>Lootbound: take risks, build your squad and create your build </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every run starts with you alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you move across the map, choose a route that leads to valuable loot. Along the way, you will meet companions who will help you fight this difficult battle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/a3447325f1e728fb2491ede07392d0bc.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/a3447325f1e728fb2491ede07392d0bc.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/a3447325f1e728fb2491ede07392d0bc.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Team and equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to collect a separate set of equipment for the hero and each companion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items do not have fixed slots. You can rotate them and place them in the inventory as long as there is free space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/62f1b9690051f6302b2f23241aafdcc9.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/62f1b9690051f6302b2f23241aafdcc9.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/62f1b9690051f6302b2f23241aafdcc9.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Item auras</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Items become truly powerful when they start affecting one another. Some items have auras that strengthen weapons or armor in adjacent cells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sometimes moving an item by a single cell is enough to change the entire build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/13dc825c0524c8d6fdca665776dbb9ab.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/13dc825c0524c8d6fdca665776dbb9ab.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/13dc825c0524c8d6fdca665776dbb9ab.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Companions and abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In combat, you control only the main hero.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Companions act on their own. They already know what to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/55faf3ab768ad58168ebb1517976b93d.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/55faf3ab768ad58168ebb1517976b93d.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/55faf3ab768ad58168ebb1517976b93d.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Create the final GUARDIAN</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">At the end of each biome, you choose one of two boss parts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each part changes the Guardian's appearance and power. After completing all biomes, you will have to face the final boss.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/622acb4d82c9f625cd810cb44b35965c.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/622acb4d82c9f625cd810cb44b35965c.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/622acb4d82c9f625cd810cb44b35965c.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Risk and reward</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Some rewards in Lootbound cannot be obtained just like that.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In special rooms, you are offered several options with different difficulty levels. The more valuable the reward, the harder it is to obtain with a dice roll.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/2d518a2f692522bcd696e66d8c8d5247.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/2d518a2f692522bcd696e66d8c8d5247.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/2d518a2f692522bcd696e66d8c8d5247.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>This is Lootbound...</strong><br/><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"326\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7bfc936e8dae2ec94b8695c65bc72982.poster.avif?t=1786953687\" width=\"1138\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7bfc936e8dae2ec94b8695c65bc72982.webm?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/extras/7bfc936e8dae2ec94b8695c65bc72982.mp4?t=1786953687\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Lootbound is a tactical roguelite with turn-based combat, loot management and D&D elements set in a dark fantasy world. Fight dangerous enemies, collect epic loot, recruit allies and lead them on a path of adventure.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3091140/0f52f0d28b3e8ae6023d919423a9953cf4c39df6/header.jpg?t=1786953687", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Strategy", "Roguelike", "Turn-Based Combat", "Inventory Management", "Pixel Graphics", "Dungeon Crawler"], "developers": "ArtDock", "publishers": "ArtDock", "release_date": "Aug 14, 2026", "price": "$14.99", "appid": "3091140", "review_type": "Recommended", "curator_desc": "10 September 2025 - Request Access\n\n19 February 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/vdb7nufNrus", "first_seen": 1757462400.0, "review_rank": 1492}